    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d68ea0eb-7e00-57ba-bb47-c3e8fe9680e1" activityNameId="f705f823-8501-5bde-ad9c-0ef62c77bfeb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ethyl acetate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ethyl acetate, at plant
The process "ethyl acetate, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of ethyl  acetate from ethanol in Europe. Raw materials and energy consumptions are modelled with literature data. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000123-86-4; 
Formula: C4H8O2; 
Synonyms: ethyl acetic ester, acetic ether, acetidin, acetoxyethane, ethyl ethanoate; 
UUID: 94623f8e-f338-311a-a25f-e410d80dcd2a
Production of ethyl acetate including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Esterification of ethanol
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: Total production in the world  is around 1.3 Million tons.
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_94623f8e-f338-311a-a25f-e410d80dcd2a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
